**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.claude
**/backups
**/frontend/dist
**/*.import
*.md
# Cherry-pick the animation preview sheets out of art_pipeline/ for
# the dashboard's /anim/ mount. We exclude one path level at a time so
# only animations/sheets/{*.gif,*.json} survives — no prompts/, no
# characters/, no master PNGs (~10MB each, used only in-engine).
card_game/art_pipeline/*
!card_game/art_pipeline/animations
card_game/art_pipeline/animations/*
!card_game/art_pipeline/animations/sheets
card_game/art_pipeline/animations/sheets/*
!card_game/art_pipeline/animations/sheets/*.gif
!card_game/art_pipeline/animations/sheets/*.json
card_game/data/
card_game/scenes/
card_game/scripts/
card_game/shaders/
card_game/project.godot
card_game/default_bus_layout.tres
